  data: {
    LLM: 'In positive contracts, focus on capturing high-value cards. The 5-point cards (kings, SkÃ¼s, XXI, I) are the most important. Try to win tricks containing these cards.\n\nWhen exchanging with the talon, evaluate both packets carefully. Look for packets containing kings or high trumps. When calling a king, choose a suit where you need help.\n\nMaster the timing of announcements. Announcing a bonus (like Pagat Ultimo) doubles its value but commits you to achieving it. Calculate whether the risk is worth the reward. In negative contracts, the strategy reverses - you must carefully control your trick-taking.',
